The parent holds three trees. Their branch sigils differ; their addressed worksite does not.

<<~ ahu #/ridge>>

Ridge is sharktooth-authored.

<<fragment #/ridge/fern>>

Fern is English-authored inside the ridge.

<<~ ahu #/ridge/fern/spore>>

Spore returns to sharktooth at depth three.

<<~/ahu>>

<</fragment>>

<<~/ahu>>

<<fragment #/tide>>

Tide is English-authored.

<<~ ahu #/tide/reef>>

Reef is sharktooth-authored inside the tide.

<<fragment #/tide/reef/fish>>

Fish returns to English at depth three.

<</fragment>>

<<~/ahu>>

<</fragment>>

<<~ ahu #/sky>>

Sky is a second sharktooth root.

<<fragment #/sky/cloud>>

Cloud is its English child.

<</fragment>>

<<~/ahu>>

